{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0050-s001", "text": "Du är skyldig", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0050-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 1.9504761904761905, "peak": 0.27630615234375, "generation_seconds": 11.012270915089175, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0051-s001", "text": "Att följa ordningsreglerna i ditt bostadsaktiebolag om du bor i ett höghus eller ett radhus.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0051-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.452178955078125, "generation_seconds": 37.097514075925574, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0051-s002", "text": "I ordningsreglerna anges vanligtvis till exempel tiderna för när det ska vara tyst i huset.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0051-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.352386474609375, "generation_seconds": 32.5129648221191, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0051-s003", "text": "Ofta innehåller de även anvisningar om användningen av gemensamma utrymmen i huset.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0051-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.28143310546875, "generation_seconds": 30.117226670030504, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0051-s004", "text": "I ett höghus hittar du ordningsreglerna vanligtvis i trapphuset nära entrédörren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0051-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.300750732421875, "generation_seconds": 33.04129242687486, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0053-s001", "text": "Att se till att även dina gäster följer ordningsreglerna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0053-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.341522216796875, "generation_seconds": 20.852053003152832, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0054-s001", "text": "Att enbart använda bostaden för det avsedda ändamålet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0054-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.388671875, "generation_seconds": 20.306476661004126, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0054-s002", "text": "Om bostaden är avsedd att användas för boende, kan du inte bo på ett annat ställe och använda bostaden som lokal.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0054-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.031020408163265, "peak": 0.388702392578125, "generation_seconds": 35.76923807896674, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0055-s001", "text": "Du har rätt", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0055-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 1.811156462585034, "peak": 0.317626953125, "generation_seconds": 9.78780258493498, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0056-s001", "text": "Att leva ett normalt liv i ditt hem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0056-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.356689453125, "generation_seconds": 14.407190855126828, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0056-s002", "text": "Bostadsaktiebolaget kan inte utfärda sådana ordningsregler som står i strid med lagen eller begränsar ett normalt liv i alltför stor omfattning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0056-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.26013605442177, "peak": 0.417938232421875, "generation_seconds": 42.178172810934484, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0058-s001", "text": "Till hemfrid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0058-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 1.8808163265306121, "peak": 0.29913330078125, "generation_seconds": 11.59891702607274, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0058-s002", "text": "Dina grannar får inte störa din hemfrid till exempel genom att föra oljud mitt i natten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0058-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.259613037109375, "generation_seconds": 29.852204772876576, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0058-s003", "text": "Om en granne ofta bryter mot ordningsreglerna på ett allvarligt sätt, ska du först ta upp saken med grannen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0058-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.125442176870749, "peak": 0.376312255859375, "generation_seconds": 39.14335549296811, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0058-s004", "text": "Om detta inte hjälper, kan du kontakta disponenten eller hyresvärden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0058-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.3463134765625, "generation_seconds": 22.878762857057154, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0058-s005", "text": "Hemfrid innebär också att du i regel själv får bestämma vem som har tillträde till ditt hem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0058-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.3388671875, "generation_seconds": 27.14166830200702, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0059-s001", "text": "Du är skyldig", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0059-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 1.9504761904761905, "peak": 0.269927978515625, "generation_seconds": 8.936993412906304, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0060-s001", "text": "Att betala hyran i tid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0060-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.507755102040816, "peak": 0.503204345703125, "generation_seconds": 11.033916646847501, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0060-s002", "text": "Hyresbeloppet anges i hyresavtalet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0060-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.396484375, "generation_seconds": 15.154460133053362, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0060-s003", "text": "Hyresvärden kan höja hyran i enlighet med vad som anges i hyresavtalet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0060-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.266265869140625, "generation_seconds": 21.858003238914534, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0062-s001", "text": "Att se till att hyresbostaden hålls i ett gott skick.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0062-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.608306884765625, "generation_seconds": 18.735003057168797, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0063-s001", "text": "Att följa villkoren i hyresavtalet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0063-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4829931972789114, "peak": 0.28863525390625, "generation_seconds": 12.641575694084167, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0063-s002", "text": "Om det till exempel anges i hyresavtalet att det är förbjudet att röka i bostaden, kan du inte röka i ditt hem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0063-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.40594482421875, "generation_seconds": 35.15652348799631, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0063-s003", "text": "Ta om du har husdjur reda på om du har rätt att ha sådana i bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0063-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.270599365234375, "generation_seconds": 22.763413654174656, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0063-s004", "text": "Om hyresavtalet kräver att du har en hemförsäkring, måste du teckna en sådan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0063-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.292236328125, "generation_seconds": 24.187261305982247, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0063-s005", "text": "Det är bra att teckna en hemförsäkring även om detta inte krävs i hyresavtalet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0063-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.287506103515625, "generation_seconds": 24.530912237009034, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0064-s001", "text": "Att fråga om tillstånd hos hyresvärden om du vill göra ändringar i bostaden, till exempel måla en vägg.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0064-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.393402099609375, "generation_seconds": 29.34011542517692, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0064-s002", "text": "Utan tillstånd får du inte göra några ändringar, även om du skulle bekosta renoveringen själv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0064-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.278228759765625, "generation_seconds": 32.60665608989075, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0064-s003", "text": "Begär tillståndet skriftligt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0064-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.995374149659864, "peak": 0.301300048828125, "generation_seconds": 11.645356650929898, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0065-s001", "text": "Att ersätta hyresvärden för skador som du åsamkar bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0065-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.330535888671875, "generation_seconds": 19.503698506159708, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0066-s001", "text": "Att meddela hyresvärden om du upptäcker sådana fel i bostaden som hyresvärden ansvarar för.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0066-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.2532958984375, "generation_seconds": 26.035385217983276, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0066-s002", "text": "Hyresvärden ansvarar till exempel för bostadens fasta inredning och ytmaterial.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0066-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.393524169921875, "generation_seconds": 22.67822679784149, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0067-s001", "text": "Att meddela eventuella fel till fastighetsskötseln, till exempel en läckande kran.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0067-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.38201904296875, "generation_seconds": 22.65150096290745, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0068-s001", "text": "Du har rätt", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0068-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 1.811156462585034, "peak": 0.248138427734375, "generation_seconds": 6.856635726988316, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0069-s001", "text": "Att bo i hyreslägenheten enligt vad som anges i hyresavtalet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0069-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.49481201171875, "generation_seconds": 17.17561858589761, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0069-s002", "text": "Hyresvärden får endast beträda bostaden i vissa undantagsfall, till exempel för att övervaka reparationer i bostaden eller visa bostaden för köpare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0069-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.165714285714285, "peak": 0.37213134765625, "generation_seconds": 40.47012434294447, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0069-s003", "text": "Även då måste hen försöka i förväg komma överens om detta med dig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0069-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.252410888671875, "generation_seconds": 22.162716736085713, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0071-s001", "text": "Att få ett skriftligt meddelande i förväg om hyran höjs.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0071-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.3023681640625, "generation_seconds": 18.175896430853754, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0071-s002", "text": "I meddelandet ska det stå hur mycket och när hyran kommer att höjas och vad som är grunden till höjningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0071-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.268768310546875, "generation_seconds": 22.429035044042394, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0071-s003", "text": "Om villkoren och tidpunkten för hyreshöjningen står i hyresavtalet, kan hyresvärden höja hyran på grundval av avtalet utan separat meddelande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0071-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.19047619047619, "peak": 0.28106689453125, "generation_seconds": 26.446422989014536, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0072-s001", "text": "Till en uppsägningstid enligt lag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0072-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.274013605442177, "peak": 0.253570556640625, "generation_seconds": 7.342724991030991, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0073-s001", "text": "Att häva hyresavtalet omedelbart om det är skadligt för hälsan att bo i bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0073-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.322113037109375, "generation_seconds": 18.95623457687907, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0074-s001", "text": "Att hyra ut en del av bostaden till en annan person, om detta inte medför olägenhet för hyresvärden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0074-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.437652587890625, "generation_seconds": 20.465849108994007, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0075-s001", "text": "Att få ett förhandsmeddelande om reparationer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0075-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.443695068359375, "generation_seconds": 10.647312093991786, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0075-s002", "text": "Små reparationer ska meddelas 14 dagar i förväg och stora reparationer sex månader i förväg.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0075-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.2218017578125, "generation_seconds": 20.90380454622209, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0075-s003", "text": "Brådskande reparationer kan dock göras utan ett meddelande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0075-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.3131103515625, "generation_seconds": 14.352255888050422, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0075-s004", "text": "Om det är svårt eller omöjligt att bo i bostaden under reparationerna, har du rätt att säga upp hyresavtalet eller får nedsatt hyra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0075-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.354557823129252, "peak": 0.295806884765625, "generation_seconds": 40.86850239895284, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0075-s005", "text": "Detta måste du emellertid alltid komma överens om med hyresvärden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0075-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.45361328125, "generation_seconds": 19.804623785894364, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0076-s001", "text": "Det är en god idé för hyresgästen att besöka bostaden tillsammans med hyresvärden före flytten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0076-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.269989013671875, "generation_seconds": 26.849966692039743, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0076-s002", "text": "Det är bra att anteckna och fotografera vilka fel som finns eller vilka reparationer som behövs i bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0076-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.125442176870749, "peak": 0.360015869140625, "generation_seconds": 34.54260274604894, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0076-s003", "text": "Då blir hyresgästen inte tvungen att betala för gamla fel när hen flyttar ut från bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0076-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.310546875, "generation_seconds": 33.59609399107285, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0077-s001", "text": "Hyresvärden eller husbolaget ska alltid utan dröjsmål informeras om skadedjur som upptäcks i en bostad eller byggnad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0077-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.383026123046875, "generation_seconds": 40.157620548969135, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0077-s002", "text": "Skadedjur är till exempel vägglöss, möss och råttor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0077-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.313690185546875, "generation_seconds": 16.140780283138156, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0077-s003", "text": "Skadedjur sprider sig lätt mellan bostäder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0077-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.179591836734694, "peak": 0.34808349609375, "generation_seconds": 13.681519143050537, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0077-s004", "text": "Därför är det viktigt att de bekämpas samtidigt i alla bostäder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0077-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.29388427734375, "generation_seconds": 20.709278892027214, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0078-s001", "text": "Det är bra att alltid göra hyresavtalet skriftligt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0078-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.426666259765625, "generation_seconds": 18.238766130059958, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0078-s002", "text": "Då är det tydligt vad man har kommit överens om, om det senare uppstår meningsskiljaktigheter med hyresvärden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0078-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.281494140625, "generation_seconds": 28.45652133016847, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0078-s003", "text": "Om det uppstår en tvist med hyresvärden kan Konsumentförbundets boenderådgivning ge råd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0078-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.20550537109375, "generation_seconds": 22.527353818994015, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0078-s004", "text": "Även Konsumentrådgivningen erbjuder rådgivning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresgast/narration/hb-c11-u0078-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.28253173828125, "generation_seconds": 13.692704954883084, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
